mes New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The problem with defending the purity of the English language is that English is about as pure as a cribhouse whore. We don't just borrow words; on occasion, English has pursued other languages down alleyways to beat them unconscious and rifle their pockets for new vocabulary. - James. D. Nicoll</span></span></i>","edited":{"userid":540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","user":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","date":". 11-05-2014, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","name":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T10:23:06-08:00","id":303385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/302506-rules-questions-iron-skin-multiple-styles?p=302854#post302854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">P. 158:<br /> <br /> Merits marked as Style Merits allow access to specialized<br /> maneuvers. Each maneuver is a prerequisite for the next in its<br /> sequence. So if a Style Merit has a three-dot maneuver and a<br /> four-dot maneuver, you must purchase the three-dot version<br /> before accessing the four-dot.<br /> <br /> At least, I read that as costing 1xp for the first, 2xp for the second, etc, etc. That's how it worked in 1e, so I'm assuming that's what they meant here (I hope a dev can clarify.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I read that as simply stating you couldn't spend 1xp to cherry pick the dots in the merit you wanted. For example, with Martial Arts, I couldn't just buy the 5th dot in the style for 1xp.<br /> <br /> Dev clarification would be nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2853-wampa","name":"wampa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T10:50:22-08:00","id":303401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wampa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/302506-rules-questions-iron-skin-multiple-styles?p=303385#post303385\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I read that as simply stating you couldn't spend 1xp to cherry pick the dots in the merit you wanted. For example, with Martial Arts, I couldn't just buy the 5th dot in the style for 1xp.<br /> <br /> Dev clarification would be nice.</div> </div> </div> </div>You must buy each level before you can get the next level. Each level costs 1XP in 2nd Edition.<br /> Dev's have already clarified this several times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The problem with defending the purity of the English language is that English is about as pure as a cribhouse whore. We